              is on the
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/diagonal"} diagonal
            %p
              But observe that, as indicated in the above formula, the term over the brace may be understood as the coefficient at order
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
