            %p
              is the truncation of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/vertex+redefinition"} vertex redefinition
              to degree
              = succeed "." do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
